/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T13:19:02-07:00","id":964491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/964314-conspiracy-theories-in-cofd?p=964458#post964458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is, if Patriarchy is literal force in <b>Mage </b>universe and was interesting idea of it's 'god' working secretly for power of feminism. Pitty you deleted last post of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2241\" data-vbnamecard=\"2241\">Omegaphallic</a> on conspiracy...</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:red\">It was a thinly-veiled attack against feminists, and against the forum rules, regardless of whether or not you feel it was on-topic. Also, since it seems like everyone needs a reminder of our policy regarding disputes with moderator action...</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Forum Rules</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Disputes between community members and the moderators, web administrators or Onyx Path staff should be handled privately, as should discussion of site policy and moderator actions. To discuss problems or concerns, use the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\">Contact Us</a> link.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:red\">Also for the record, Freedom of Speech (for example, under the US government) applies specifically to government censorship. When you sign up for a privately-run forum or other social website, you agree to the terms of service, which the post in question violated. The US Constitution has nothing to do with it.<br /> <br /> Further deviations from the topic will result in suspensions.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T13:34:41-07:00","id":964498,"title":"","content":"I did a little work on a host that was supposed to be one of the reasons behind the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reptilians\" target=\"_blank\">reptiloid conspiracy</a>, as they were basically reptilian-like things that would possess people, at certain points, became able to shapeshift. They worked off of an independent-to-communal axis against a humility-to-pride axis, so there were groups that would slowly take over entire towns and stay mostly insular and keep hidden, while other groups would go out and try to take over companies or governments and try to pave the way to be able to take over the Earth, or at least make it more fitting for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T16:21:59-07:00","id":964607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/964314-conspiracy-theories-in-cofd?p=964458#post964458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It is, if Patriarchy is literal force in <b>Mage </b>universe and was interesting idea of it's 'god' working secretly for power of feminism. Pitty you deleted last post of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2241\" data-vbnamecard=\"2241\">Omegaphallic</a> on conspiracy...</div> </div> </div> </div> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">\u200bThat will be a week off for the moderator backtalk. This subject isn't open for discussion or debate.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T04:30:33-07:00","id":964890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/964314-conspiracy-theories-in-cofd?p=964491#post964491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:red\">Also for the record, Freedom of Speech (for example, under the US government) applies specifically to government censorship. When you sign up for a privately-run forum or other social website, you agree to the terms of service, which the post in question violated. The US Constitution has nothing to do with it.<br /> <br /> Further deviations from the topic will result in suspensions.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>I'll have to take the punishment here or I won't get peace of mind.<br /> It's the principle of free speech which is important, I realize you're a private site and set whatever rules you have, but it hurts the site if people cannot express basic opinions on topics that exist in real life in a game that is set on modern-day earth and all that entails (and more). Obviously I won't speak against you acting against someone unironically saying &quot;Jews are evil&quot; or &quot;feminists should all die&quot; or whatever, but cracking down on parodies or non-serious ideas for things you can do as shits and giggles makes the site toxic as fuck. I'm not saying this to talk shit on the way Onyx Path handles the forums, but rather as constructive criticism to combat a feeling of discomfort everytime I look through the site because I know you keep cracking down on harmless stuff like opinions on the internet; and barely even that in this case.<br /> <br /> Punishment aside, I will try not to advocate any further from hereon to avoid irritation on both ends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T06:19:30-07:00","id":964922,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#ff0000\">Charlaquin posted the rules as to how to handle disagreement with moderator action and you ignored it. Moderator action is not open for public debate or discussion. Making thinly veiled group attacks makes a site &quot;toxic as fuck&quot; and we will not tolerate it. That's a week suspension.<br /> <br /> <br /> Using the &quot;flag&quot; feature to report moderator action is against the rules and is also a bannable offense. Since Omegaphallic decided to ignore forum rules and do just that, and was the instigator of the original moderator action, they can take some time off as well.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":11,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","user":"Darksider","date":". 09-07-2016, 09:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T10:06:47-07:00","id":965023,"title":"","content":"It's really not that hard, folks. Just use the contact us link. Use the contact us link. It's stated twice in the forum rules and we repeat it every time someone tries to publicly dispute a mod's call. If you really feel something the mod team is doing is unconscionable and you feel you have to say something, say it! Through the contact us link. I promise you it will do far, far more good than ranting about it publicly, and won't get you suspended to boot. Just use the contact us link.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T10:44:41-07:00","id":965060,"title":"","content":"so... let's bring this thread back to course?<br /> <br /> Personally, I believe that just saying &quot;aliens&quot; or something like that is too simple for the setting- the reason is that the chances are that you are right, in a way. In a world of conspiracies and dark things in the shadows, real conspiracy theories has to be bigger than the usual. It is not that there are vampires in the church- it is that vampires are a parasitic lifeform from outer space, and that werewolves are the hybrids of such aliens with mankind, and mages are radio stations who make contact with faraway plants. Or perhaps the devil is the true power behind it all- sin eaters are souls which escaped from Hell, mummies are people who were sold to the Prince of Darkness by an ancient demon worshiping culture and the God Machine is a tool meant to become Satan's body on earth built by countless cults through history. Or maybe everything we think that exist is just a virtual reality in which we are all trapped, and the supernatural creatures are corrupted programs- changelings are codes which were corrupted by the GENTRY virus, prometheans are bugs in the system of virtual accounts without users which are &quot;fixed&quot; when a new user finally takes their place, beasts are people who have a cheat which allows them to access a virtual sub-space with a new customized body features.<br /> <br /> Or maybe something stranger still- those are the Chronicles of Darkness, after all. In such weird and broken world, it only makes sense that conspiracy theories would be a lot weirder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T11:47:40-07:00","id":965137,"title":"","content":"Let me have a shot at the more story hook style post.<br /> <br /> - Kubrick didn't fake the moon landings. He was brought in to help edit out the strange structures and mind-rending images that were found after the initial landings.<br /> <br /> - Huey Long was killed by a ghouled bodyguard, ordered to wait for the right moment to kill then man who threatened to remove easy sources of blood.<br /> <br /> - Project Stargate was easily subverted by the Seers of the Throne, specifically the Panopticon, until the Hegemonic Ministry decided the program wasn't intense enough and the project disbanded by the US government.<br /> <br /> - The rise of militias in the 80s and 90s was in part organized by desperate changelings, trying to prove that mortals could help against the Gentry in meaningful ways. They didn't couldn't predict the US men in black taking issues with small personal armies appearing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T12:42:52-07:00","id":965193,"title":"","content":"There's an interesting bit of crossover conspiracy theory in Mythologies for Requiem. One of the alt-origins for the Kindred (Eve and the Serpent) is actually a RL Christian anti-semitic conspiracy theory (just replace Jews for Vampires). I only heard about the latter after reading a sociological study of conspiracy theory culture which was kinda shocking as I really liked the vampire version.<br /> <br /> It brings one of the real issues with using conspiracy theory stuff. A lot of it is... problematic at best.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> - Kubrick didn't fake the moon landings. He was brought in to help edit out the strange structures and mind-rending images that were found after the initial landings. </div> </div> </div>That's quite brilliant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T12:52:02-07:00","id":965200,"title":"","content":"-JFK was not shot. Not the one elected for president anyways. He shot a man pretending to be him as a result of things breaking down because he was about to gain access to something truly vital. You know this because he was the last person you expected to meet in your organization's Board of Directors.<br /> <br /> Truth is, he's #08 out of 130","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T13:25:41-07:00","id":965229,"title":"","content":"One thing that was mentioned in the Mage 2e Open Dev is that the Orders are things with <i>presence</i>, tendrils and paper-trails under the skin of the world 